      "preview": "אֵימָה: substantivo feminino terror, pavor; flexões, singular e plural, usos figurados.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימָה</span></big><sub>17</sub> <strong>subst. fem.: terror, pavor</strong> (no Talmude, o mesmo vocábulo; cf. assírio <em>imtu</em>, Dl<sup>W</sup>)—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:12\" href=\"/Genesis.15.12\">Gn 15:12</a> e outras ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימָ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:16\" href=\"/Exodus.15.16\">Ex 15:16</a> (cf. Ges<sup>§ 90, 2 R. b</sup>); estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.2\">Pr 20:2</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:27\" href=\"/Exodus.23.27\">Ex 23:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵמָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:7\" href=\"/Job.33.7\">Jb 33:7</a> etc.; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.38\">Je 50:38</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 20:25\" href=\"/Job.20.25\">Jb 20:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:5\" href=\"/Psalms.55.5\">ψ 55:5</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵמֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:16\" href=\"/Psalms.88.16\">ψ 88:16</a>;—<em>terror, pavor</em> (sobretudo na poesia), inspirado por <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:16\" href=\"/Exodus.15.16\">Ex 15:16</a> (cântico em E, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּחַד</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:27\" href=\"/Exodus.23.27\">23:27</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.25\">Dt 32:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:34\" href=\"/Job.9.34\">Jb 9:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:21\" href=\"/Job.13.21\">13:21</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 33:7\" href=\"/Job.33.7\">33:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 20:25\" href=\"/Job.20.25\">20:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:16\" href=\"/Psalms.88.16\">ψ 88:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲרוֹנִים</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּעוּתִים</span>; ver <a data-ref=\"Job 20:17\" href=\"/Job.20.17\">17</a>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:12\" href=\"/Genesis.15.12\">Gn 15:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימָה חֲשֵׁכָה גְדֹלָה</span>; causado por inimigos, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 2:9\" href=\"/Joshua.2.9\">Jos 2:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.18\">Is 33:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:3\" href=\"/Ezra.3.3\">Ezr 3:3</a>; pelo rei, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.2\">Pr 20:2</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:5\" href=\"/Psalms.55.5\">ψ 55:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵימוֹת מָוֶת</span> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יִרְאָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רַעַד</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּלָּצוּת</span>; ver <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:6\" href=\"/Psalms.55.6\">6</a>); predicado do resfolegar de um cavalo de guerra, <a data-ref=\"Job 39:20\" href=\"/Job.39.20\">Jb 39:20</a>, e dos dentes do crocodilo, <a data-ref=\"Job 41:6\" href=\"/Job.41.6\">Jb 41:6</a>; plural figurado = ídolos (isto é, coisas terríveis, chocantes), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.38\">Je 50:38</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פּסלים</span>).",
